{
    "background_story": "Koen was a skilled diplomat, known for his ability to navigate complex webs of international relations. His latest assignment was to broker a peace treaty between two warring nations. The stakes were high, and the task seemed impossible, but Koen was determined to succeed. He spent countless hours meeting with leaders, listening to their concerns, and finding common ground. His calm and objective demeanor earned him the respect of both sides, and slowly but surely, he began to make progress. After months of grueling negotiations, Koen finally succeeded in bringing the two nations to the table, where they signed a historic treaty. His assignment had been a daunting one, but Koen's skill and dedication had paid off, earning him a reputation as one of the world's top diplomats.",
